SHAPEFILE_1_SEARCH_ENVELOPE "$(SHAPEFILE_IN_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_MINY_SHAPEFILE_1)"
GUI OPTIONAL FLOAT SHAPEFILE_IN_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_MINY_SHAPEFILE_1 Minimum Y:
# ===========================================================================
